WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.860
It was early morning in Metro City.

2
00:00:05.861 --> 00:00:09.222
A pickup truck drove onto a construction site.

3
00:00:09.223 --> 00:00:12.646
Three workers got out of the truck.

4
00:00:12.647 --> 00:00:16.964
They were building a new skyscraper.

5
00:00:16.965 --> 00:00:20.823
"We have a lot of work to do today," said one man.

6
00:00:20.824 --> 00:00:25.753
Suddenly the workers heard something. Whirr!

7
00:00:25.754 --> 00:00:28.611
"What's that sound?" asked a woman.

8
00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:32.475
Whirr!

9
00:00:32.476 --> 00:00:34.913
"Look!" cried the other man.

10
00:00:34.914 --> 00:00:41.186
"The new skyscraper is shrinking!"

11
00:00:41.187 --> 00:00:43.900
Roxy and her friends were walking to school.

12
00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:46.696
They walked past Rocky Mountain Bakery.

13
00:00:46.697 --> 00:00:53.066
"Mmm," said Mara. "The bakery smells good!"

14
00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:56.999
"We should buy cookies after school," said Terrell.

15
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.694
"Good idea," said Jack.

16
00:00:59.695 --> 00:01:01.627
"Look," said Mara.

17
00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:04.668
"It's the Metro City Movie Theater."

18
00:01:04.669 --> 00:01:07.544
Mara pointed to a very old building.

19
00:01:07.545 --> 00:01:09.893
Boards covered its windows.

20
00:01:09.894 --> 00:01:11.907
Cracks ran along the walls.

21
00:01:11.908 --> 00:01:13.987
Weeds grew in front of it.

22
00:01:13.988 --> 00:01:18.340
"It's sad that the old theater went out of business," said Jack.

23
00:01:18.341 --> 00:01:21.059
"I saw lots of movies there."

24
00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.852
"I did too," said Terrell.

25
00:01:23.853 --> 00:01:27.006
"But now there's a fancy new theater downtown.

26
00:01:27.007 --> 00:01:29.361
It has 12 screens!

27
00:01:29.362 --> 00:01:32.250
It even has movies in 3-D!"

28
00:01:32.251 --> 00:01:36.425
"I saw lots of movies in the old theater too," said Mara.

29
00:01:36.426 --> 00:01:39.782
"But now my parents hope it gets knocked down."

30
00:01:39.783 --> 00:01:42.229
"Why?" asked Jack.

31
00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:46.612
"People want to plant a community garden on the lot," said Mara.

32
00:01:46.613 --> 00:01:50.100
"They want to grow fruits and vegetables there."

33
00:01:50.101 --> 00:01:52.808
"That would be cool," said Roxy.

34
00:01:52.809 --> 00:01:56.517
"A garden would look much nicer than that old building."

35
00:01:56.518 --> 00:02:02.206
Mara nodded. "But first workers need to knock it down."

36
00:02:02.207 --> 00:02:04.493
Terrell's eyes lit up.

37
00:02:04.494 --> 00:02:06.969
"They should get Rocket Girl to help!

38
00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:10.195
She could knock down the old theater!"

39
00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.341
Roxy rolled her eyes.

40
00:02:12.342 --> 00:02:20.419
"I'm sure Rocket Girl has more important things to do."

41
00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:24.479
Terrell frowned. "You're probably right.

42
00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:28.253
But I'm sure she could do it."

43
00:02:28.254 --> 00:02:30.651
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

44
00:02:30.652 --> 00:02:32.638
She looked at her friends.

45
00:02:32.639 --> 00:02:34.537
"Oh," said Roxy.

46
00:02:34.538 --> 00:02:37.540
"Did I bring my lunch money?"

47
00:02:37.541 --> 00:02:41.330
Roxy stopped walking and pretended to look in her backpack.

48
00:02:41.331 --> 00:02:44.098
She pressed a button on her watch.

49
00:02:44.099 --> 00:02:48.246
"Mayor Bloom," she said quietly. "What's up?"

50
00:02:48.247 --> 00:02:50.865
"Rocket Girl!" said the mayor.

51
00:02:50.866 --> 00:02:54.103
"Metro City's new skyscraper is gone!"

52
00:02:54.104 --> 00:02:56.957
"It's gone?" Roxy was confused.

53
00:02:56.958 --> 00:02:58.750
"What happened to it?"

54
00:02:58.751 --> 00:03:02.725
"It shrank and then disappeared!" said the mayor.

55
00:03:02.726 --> 00:03:07.008
"Workers saw a . . . Oh no!"

56
00:03:07.009 --> 00:03:10.956
"Mayor Bloom!" said Roxy. "What's wrong?"

57
00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:16.078
"Help us, Rocket Girl!" Mayor Bloom's voice suddenly sounded tiny.

58
00:03:16.079 --> 00:03:18.265
"Help us!"

59
00:03:18.266 --> 00:03:22.490
"Mayor Bloom? Mayor Bloom?" cried Roxy.

60
00:03:22.491 --> 00:03:24.772
The mayor didn't answer.

61
00:03:24.773 --> 00:03:30.415
"Uh-oh," said Roxy.

